  "tagline": "Globally distributed serverless vector index for Cloudflare Workers and Workers AI.",
  "description": "Vectorize is Cloudflare's managed vector database, queried from Workers through a binding or over the REST API, and designed to pair with Workers AI embedding models, R2 and D1 for RAG at the edge. Indexes hold up to 20 million vectors of up to 1,536 dimensions with metadata filtering on up to 10 indexed fields and namespaces for tenant isolation. Pricing is based on queried and stored vector dimensions, with a free allowance on the Workers Free plan. It is the obvious choice inside a Cloudflare stack, but limits on index size, topK and dimensions rule it out for large or high-dimensional workloads.",
